%SIXMD 1
# @?FALSE - RETURN FAILURE

## DESCRIPTION

EXITS WITH FAILURE STATUS.

USAGE IS 'FALSE'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/FALSE
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/FALSE.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

